{"title":"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 47","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_47&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>An engineer said he could finish a highway section in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> days with his present supply of a certain type of machine. \nHowever, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more of these machines the job could be done in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> days. If the machines all work at the same rate, \nhow many days would it take to do the job with one machine? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/6/8e688d3ab8a070958e5f4788910a927b0251e1e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 6 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 12 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 15 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 18 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"385\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_47&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In 1 day, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> machines can do <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/2/b8229eaa7fcc15afd947a18d7c921214b5d94748.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> \nof the job , and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/2/2b2e1d87b1d3aefe9596c2581cda95f088aee03a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"14\" /> machines<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/6/7b6e1f3fb13ce14a224503cae0227779aca077ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" />\nof the job. So  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> machines can do <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/6/b86009c88f22a309a497bf28117cf3bbf1c162f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {1}{2} -\\frac {1}{3}=\\frac {1}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"84\" height=\"37\" /> of the job in 1 day, and 1 machine can do<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/b/57b3708dde3660a7689062d2c85a3e4ebf04ab3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {1}{18}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" /> of the job in 1 day. Hence, **18** days are needed for 1 machine to complete the job;\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_47&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"ma